{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/5a8bfc134c107f5f62e6096a9a16490a.avif?t=1759478789\" width=615 height=91 /></span><br><br>It\u2019s official. The Grinch has had a change of heart and now he wants to show every Who in Who-ville just how much. Get into the Christmassy spirit with him and Max swinging, sleighing, and even parachuting through the snowy land, gathering food to put on a festive feast. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/ebdf1223289b92c9c6e5ffde56a8c70b.poster.avif?t=1759478789\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/ebdf1223289b92c9c6e5ffde56a8c70b.webm?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/ebdf1223289b92c9c6e5ffde56a8c70b.mp4?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These missions will be full of puzzles to solve, fun accessories to unlock, and new obstacles to dodge. Watch out for those icicles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/1b79614358f3fb54040ff3f9b7b21ed8.avif?t=1759478789\" width=615 height=91 /></span><br><br>DLC includes:<br><br> - Six new levels<br> - Fun gadgets to customize<br> - More accessories<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/e1451942b01a4fa2abb0b7523cdbb2ef.poster.avif?t=1759478789\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/e1451942b01a4fa2abb0b7523cdbb2ef.webm?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/e1451942b01a4fa2abb0b7523cdbb2ef.mp4?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/85ac7986ae8e941b0eb51aae9523c829.avif?t=1759478789\" width=615 height=91 /></span><br><br>From the Grinch Caves in Mount Crumpit down to the Village, work together to remind The Grinch he belonged all along.  <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore five new areas of Who-Ville<br></li><li>Discover a secret snow-filled level <br></li><li>Play with new gadgets, such as Max\u2019s parachute.<br></li><li>Collect Grinchy rewards by gathering food and presents.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/2c9648d9afc36ec74639cfa0072eec09.poster.avif?t=1759478789\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/2c9648d9afc36ec74639cfa0072eec09.webm?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/extras/2c9648d9afc36ec74639cfa0072eec09.mp4?t=1759478789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694440?t=1759478789","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/e924738a6fd360813d8add47fa765a9636fe14ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759478789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694440/b1512a315f42dcbf27b5fc41e6a8c53bbb6bc26e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759478789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app